/*
 * snippet::utils — reading the source a diagnostic points into.
 *
 * The helpers here answer questions about the file rather than about the
 * report: what line a location sits on, what follows it, whether there is
 * anything to show of it at all. They belong to no record, and everything that
 * lays a report out goes through them, so the whole of the module reads one
 * file the same way.
 *
 * No file I/O is performed: a `Word` carries the content it was read from.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::errors::snippet::utils
 * @File: ymirc/errors/snippet/utils.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
